{"title":"Sand Striders","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Sandlord, Dune Raider, Dune Skirmisher, Dune Captain</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-raider\" title=\"Dune Raider - dropped it in 2 of 25 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/df6ebb3872ba169f9ab2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Raider</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-sandlord\" title=\"Dune Sandlord - dropped it in 3 of 48 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4db2385dcb80af8b039d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Sandlord</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-captain\" title=\"Dune Captain - dropped it in 1 of 29 looted corpses (1/29)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/164853a853a7615813df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Captain</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/29<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"sand-striders\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/108a0459484c61113c43.svg\" alt=\"Sand Striders\"></div><h3>Sand Striders</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/17/2026, 12:27:21 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}